{"schema_version":"1.0.0","id":"cik-0001910139","cik":"0001910139","slug":"mobileye-global-910139","name":"Mobileye Global Inc.","ticker":"MBLY","exchanges":["Nasdaq"],"sector":"Services-Prepackaged Software","sic":"7372","country":"","website":"","listed_years":3.4,"first_annual":"2023-03-09","last_filing":"2026-07-23","annual_only":false,"edgar_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001910139&type=10-K","summary":{"sentences":["Mobileye Global Inc. files with the SEC under \"Services-Prepackaged Software\", based in DE, and has been publicly reporting for 3 years.","It reported $2.1bn of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 0.4% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 46.3%.","Listed on Nasdaq, it funds itself from operations ($395.0m of operating cash flow over the year)."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Gross margin of 46.3% means most of each additional sale falls through to cover fixed costs.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1910139/000110465926086264/0001104659-26-086264-index.htm","accession":"0001104659-26-086264"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $395.0m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1910139/000110465926047712/0001104659-26-047712-index.htm","accession":"0001104659-26-047712"},{"text":"Net cash of $1.3bn against total assets of $8.8bn - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1910139/000110465926086264/0001104659-26-086264-index.htm","accession":"0001104659-26-086264"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (0.7% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away."